'''Item Drop Cats''' are [[:Category:Cat Units|Cat Units]] that can be unlocked when completing certain stages. Some only have a chance of being unlocked, while others are guaranteed. For units that only have a chance of being unlocked, using a [[Battle Items#Treasure Radar|Treasure Radar]] will increase the chance to 100%.

